297: /* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
298:    Endless inspiration tracks
299:    A real Grand Prix centre line is mirrored, stretched, rotated and
300:    deformed by a smooth warp field. The underlying shape keeps the straights
301:    and corner sequences that make a circuit feel real; the warp makes every
302:    roll a new layout. Mutations that fold the loop are rejected and rerolled.
303:    Every roll is seeded from the clock, so the well is infinite.
304:    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
